{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/763388-help-understanding-angels","id":763388,"title":"Help understanding Angels","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-11T13:14:26-08:00","id":763388,"title":"Help understanding Angels","content":"I don't think I understand the dangers of Angels is it the large dice pools?, the ability to use influence?, Numina?, the connection to the twilight? God Machine alterations to the numina?, or some innate abilities that they possess. I need some help understanding what makes Angels so dangerous?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3839-crytofloragardener","name":"CrytofloraGardener","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T13:29:45-08:00","id":763399,"title":"","content":"An angel is one of the most persistent types of ephemeral beings that exists in the World of Darkness, being ostensibly capable of existing indefinitely even outside its supporting Infrastructure with sufficient resources; an angel without Essence does not need to be retrieved from anywhere more onerous to access than the place that it lost power, and the ritual murder of a single average mortal is enough to activate even a powerful angel for a couple of hours, during which time it's got all the usual baseline abilities of any other ephemeral being in Twilight.<br /> <br /> The first bit of Chapter Four of the corebook talks in some detail about the threats angels pose.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T13:43:45-08:00","id":763409,"title":"","content":"On it's own an angel isn't any more dangerous than another ephemeral entity of the same rank. But angels are never alone. They're a part of the God Machine. When they come for you, they come down in a <i>swarm</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T13:53:27-08:00","id":763422,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/763388-help-understanding-angels?p=763409#post763409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On it's own an angel isn't any more dangerous than another ephemeral entity of the same rank. But angels are never alone. They're a part of the God Machine. When they come for you, they come down in a <i>swarm</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Angels are not mortal cultists. Angels are not the whole of the God-Machine's processes. Angels are an investment. Angels are not cheap, in the scheme of things.<br /> <br /> They'll work in cells, certainly, but let's not lessen the narrative impact of a purpose-built sapient tool sent to capture or kill you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T14:02:24-08:00","id":763435,"title":"","content":"Also, unlike other splats that regularly interact with Ephemeral Beings (Werewolves, Mages, Sin-Eaters), Demons have no way of seeing angels in Twilight. There could be an angel anywhere, at anytime and a demon would have no way of knowing. (There is Aetheric Resonance, but that only works in certain situations and has downsides).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T14:03:25-08:00","id":763436,"title":"","content":"So it is the baseline ephemeral resilience and immortality combined with backup and persistence?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3839-crytofloragardener","name":"CrytofloraGardener","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T14:18:20-08:00","id":763454,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CrytofloraGardener</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/763388-help-understanding-angels?p=763436#post763436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So it is the baseline ephemeral resilience and immortality combined with backup and persistence?</div> </div> </div> </div>The nigh-universal ability of angels to Discorporate at will is another bit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T14:28:39-08:00","id":763467,"title":"","content":"So if a demon were to gain the hunted condition and a powerful angel were sent to kill them and retrieve the body how would it play out why is rank 4 and above treated as nigh-unstoppable. I just have a bit of difficulty turning the powers into something to fear instead of another obstacle to plan for how dangerous would this angel be to a small ring (3-5 demons)?, How would it play out against a single demon? what if the demon goes loud? and thanks everyone for the help.<br /> <br /> Programming: Destroyer (Hunter Angel)<br /> Virtue: Violent<br /> Vice: Dispassionate<br /> Rank: 4<br /> Power: 12<br /> Finesse: 7<br /> Resistance: 8<br /> Essence: 25<br /> Influence: Weapons 3, Fear 1,<br /> Corpus: 15<br /> Willpower: 10<br /> Size: 7<br /> Speed: 24 (Species Factor 5)<br /> Defense: 8<br /> Initiative: 15<br /> Armor: 3/0 (Steel Body)<br /> Numina: Stalwart, Blast (Knives), Awe, Dement, Speed, Regenerate, Seek,<br /> Manifestation: Twilight Form, Materialize, Discorporate<br /> Ban: must kill one target within 72 hours of release or is forced to Discorporate<br /> Bane: A knife crafted of gold and human bone","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3839-crytofloragardener","name":"CrytofloraGardener","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T15:02:25-08:00","id":763502,"title":"","content":"The scariest thing about Angels? They are organized. <br /> <br /> Demons may be the masters of manipulating and lying, but Angels are the true master spy ring. They know your weakness because they are always watching. When they attack, they go at you in a coordinated manner and they hit your soft points, which may or may not be physical. Bank accounts get frozen, families attacked, safe houses burned. Don't be afraid to custom build your Angels to shut down specific demons. If you've been Burned, they are coming for you with Angels made to take YOU down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T17:26:16-08:00","id":763602,"title":"","content":"How about guardians? How does a Guardian Angel defend a charge whether human or location from danger especially unaware mortal charges?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3839-crytofloragardener","name":"CrytofloraGardener","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T18:39:58-08:00","id":763651,"title":"","content":"In the God Machine Chronicle book there are Clockwork Servitors that are set to protect locations and devices important to the God Machine's plans. 'Some protect their charge from all interference, while others allow people who know a particular password to access to [sic] location or device. A few do nothing unless attempts to damage its charge.'<br /> <br /> Splintered City: Seattle brings us Tower. 'Its mission has always been to guard the site against intrusion and destruction, and to prevent the revelation of the Infrastructure. Most of its time is spent on the grounds, standing tower-straight in one of its many designated sentry positions or walking between them. when it's not there, it is out hunting someone who threatens the Infrastructure's secrecy.' When someone has threatened to make the facility public, Tower is sent visions by the Infrastructure and hunts them down, wearing Covers to facilitate the hunt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 11-11-2015, 09:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T18:59:06-08:00","id":763660,"title":"","content":"Another thing to consider on the topics of weak points: Cover is always a weak point. If the cover starts to be investigated, the Demon will get backed into a corner, especially if there is only one. <br /> <br /> You want a dangerous 4th rank Angel? This isn't the angel that attacks the Demon to their face. It's the one that has influence over curiosity and sets the private eyes, the police chiefs, and the journalists on the Demon's tail. The ones that attack the Demon by steadily eroding their cover, and the at the Demon may not even be able to track. Hell (Heaven?) you could even do that with a resourceful Rank 2 angel. Force the Demon to get sloppy. Make them make mistakes. Lay traps with other Angels lying in wait. <br /> <br /> You could probably do something similar with a Guardian. It watches for anyone trying to case out their primary, then investigates the investigators. It aims to make it not worth the cover loss and disintegrating safety net. A Numen that force Compromise checks would also be a good defensive ability. The Angel doesn't have to be able to harm the Demon directly, just make the attack so costly that it withdraws before it reaches the primary. Or, for real allusion points, make the guardian a literal Angel of Death. With the ability to influence death, it could deal lethal or aggregated damage by creating death or use its ability to chain ghosts to defend the primary. Get creative. Look for loopholes, because the God Machine is all about exploring them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}